msgstr "ເອກະສານທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ %(move_line_name)s ຖືກລຶບແລ້ວ: %(link)s"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_asset.py:0
msgid "A document linked to this move has been deleted: %s"
msgstr "ເອກະສານທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກລຶບແລ້ວ: %s"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/wizard/asset_modify.py:0
msgid "A gross increase has been created: %(link)s"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມມູນຄ່າລວມໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ: %(link)s"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/wizard/asset_modify.py:0
msgid ""
"A journal entry will transfer the asset value from <strong><em>\"%"
"(old_account)s\"</em></strong> to <strong><em>\"%(new_account)s\"</em></"
"strong> on <strong>%(date)s</strong>.<br/> The current asset will be closed "
"and a new asset will be created with the same book value.<br/> Depreciation "
"will begin from <strong>%(date)s</strong> using the depreciation parameters "
"configured on the new account."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການບັນຊີຈະໂອນມູນຄ່າຊັບສິນຈາກ <strong><em>\"%(old_account)s\"</em></strong> ໄປຍັງ "
"<strong><em>\"%(new_account)s\"</em></strong> ໃນ <strong>%(date)s</strong>."
"<br/> ຊັບສິນປະຈຸບັນຈະຖືກປິດ ແລະ ຊັບສິນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍມູນຄ່າຕາມບັນຊີດຽວກັນ.<br/> "
"ຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕັ້ງແຕ່ <strong>%(date)s</strong> "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນບັນຊີໃໝ່."

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_depreciation_model.py:0
msgid ""
"A journal with a ledger is required to create a depreciation model in this "
"context."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີສະໝຸດບັນຊີທີ່ມີບັນຊີໃຫຍ່ ເພື່ອສ້າງແບບຈຳລອງຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນໃນບໍລິບົດນີ້."

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_asset_ledger_variant.py:0
msgid ""
"A ledger sub-asset is closed together with its asset. Dispose of the asset "
"instead."
msgstr "ຊັບສິນຍ່ອຍຂອງບັນຊີໃຫຍ່ຈະຖືກປິດໄປພ້ອມກັບຊັບສິນຫຼັກ. ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການກຳຈັດຊັບສິນຫຼັກແທນ."

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_asset.py:0
msgid ""
"A non deductible tax value of %(tax_value)s was added to %(name)s's initial "
"value of %(purchase_value)s"
msgstr ""
"ມູນຄ່າອາກອນທີ່ຫັກບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳນວນ %(tax_value)s ໄດ້ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນມູນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ %(purchase_value)s "
"ຂອງ %(name)s"

#. module: account_asset
#: model:ir.model,name:account_asset.model_account_account
msgid "Account"
msgstr "ບັນຊີ"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_move.py:0
