msgstr "ບັນຊີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລາຍການຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ, ເພື່ອຫຼຸດມູນຄ່າຊັບສິນລົງ."

#. module: account_asset
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_account_asset_variant__account_depreciation_id
msgid ""
"Account used in the depreciation entries, to decrease the asset value. Value "
"obtained from Fixed Asset Account."
msgstr "ບັນຊີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລາຍການຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດມູນຄ່າຊັບສິນລົງ. ມູນຄ່າໄດ້ມາຈາກບັນຊີຊັບສິນຄົງທີ່."

#. module: account_asset
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_account_account__asset_expense_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_asset_modify__account_depreciation_expense_id
msgid ""
"Account used in the periodical entries, to record a part of the asset as "
"expense."
msgstr "ບັນຊີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລາຍການຕາມງວດ ເພື່ອບັນທຶກສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊັບສິນເປັນລາຍຈ່າຍ."

#. module: account_asset
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_account_asset_variant__account_depreciation_expense_id
msgid ""
"Account used in the periodical entries, to record a part of the asset as "
"expense. Value obtained from Fixed Asset Account."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລາຍການຕາມງວດ ເພື່ອບັນທຶກສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊັບສິນເປັນລາຍຈ່າຍ. ມູນຄ່າໄດ້ມາຈາກບັນຊີຊັບສິນຄົງທີ່."

#. module: account_asset
