#. module: account_asset
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_account_asset__method
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_account_asset_variant__method
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_account_depreciation_model__method
msgid ""
"Choose the method to use to compute the amount of depreciation lines.\n"
"  * No Depreciation\n"
"  * Straight Line: Calculated on basis of: Gross Value / Duration\n"
"  * Declining: Calculated on basis of: Residual Value * Declining Factor\n"
"  * Declining then Straight Line: Like Declining but with a minimum "
"depreciation value equal to the straight line value."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກວິທີການທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ຈຳນວນແຖວຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ.\n"
"  * ບໍ່ມີຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ\n"
"  * ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່: ຄິດໄລ່ບົນພື້ນຖານ: ມູນຄ່າລວມ / ໄລຍະເວລາ\n"
"  * ແບບຫຼຸດລົງ: ຄິດໄລ່ບົນພື້ນຖານ: ມູນຄ່າຄົງເຫຼືອ * ຕົວຄູນແບບຫຼຸດລົງ\n"
"  * ແບບຫຼຸດລົງແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເປັນແບບເສັ້ນຊື່: ຄືກັນກັບແບບຫຼຸດລົງ ແຕ່ມີມູນຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຂັ້ນຕ່ຳເທົ່າກັບມູນຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່."

