#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/controller/asset_template_controller.py:0
msgid ""
"The balance sheet account for the asset itself (e.g., \"151000 Fixed "
"Asset\"). Must exist in Odoo and be of \"Fixed Asset\" or \"Non-current "
"Assets\" type with depreciation model, accumulated depreciation, and "
"depreciation expense account set."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີໃບສະຫຼຸບຊັບສົມບັດສຳລັບຊັບສິນນັ້ນເອງ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"151000 ຊັບສິນຄົງທີ່\"). ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນ Odoo ແລະ "
"ເປັນປະເພດ \"Fixed Asset\" ຫຼື \"Non-current Assets\" ພ້ອມທັງຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຈຳລອງຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ, "
"ຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນສະສົມ, ແລະ ບັນຊີລາຍຈ່າຍຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນໄວ້ແລ້ວ."

